    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/95bfdc156d3a2e36cba209cf92aa358b.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every human has a Kasama, a dream-avatar that reflects their soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Kasama: The Awakening</i>, you\u2019ll step into the dreamworld as Orion, a spirit warrior on a quiet quest through the fading realm of Kastania.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden truths, face your fears, and help restore balance to a world teetering between light and shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short, heartfelt journey, perfect for players who love story-rich games like <i>Journey</i>, <i>Inside</i>, or <i>Oxenfree</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dare to dream... and face the night with them?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/e78b4eb34608548576f3b1783fd22180.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/65b6d2a2c83b52c529babf6ed42379a5.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span>Long ago, a sacred chestnut tree gave life to three mythical beings, protectors of the dreamworld and guides of the human soul:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Ipno</strong> \u2013 the firstborn, guardian of restful sleep for all living things.<br>\u2022 <strong>Morpheo</strong> \u2013 the middle child, who grants the power to dream and glimpse other realities.<br>\u2022 <strong>Phao</strong> \u2013 the youngest, who wakes beings from dreams and helps them carry meaning into the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when the chestnuts that sustain this balance begin to vanish, the Kasamas grow weaker... and darkness creeps in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/06317a0678df8a88a521a098e919e115.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/a8e90c449eab9bcb66551ed1f7c70a43.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span>Walk through floating forests, forgotten ruins, and shimmering dreamscapes as you piece together Kastania\u2019s lost history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every place you visit reflects a feeling, a memory, or a fear, both personal and ancient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/f5e5a2f715dc2b044733332a7f2e8961.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/05198a91f39c84d2a9b911d73309d1ed.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span>Not all dreams are peaceful.<br>Some hold sorrow. Some conceal truths. Some fight back.<br>But only by facing them can you restore what was lost.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/19c19c733887d02c0f719d0b155d3057.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><i></i><br><i>Kasama: The Awakening</i> is the first chapter in a cinematic, episodic saga, built for one-night play sessions that leave a lasting impression.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/95bfdc156d3a2e36cba209cf92aa358b.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every human has a Kasama, a dream-avatar that reflects their soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Kasama: The Awakening</i>, you\u2019ll step into the dreamworld as Orion, a spirit warrior on a quiet quest through the fading realm of Kastania.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden truths, face your fears, and help restore balance to a world teetering between light and shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short, heartfelt journey, perfect for players who love story-rich games like <i>Journey</i>, <i>Inside</i>, or <i>Oxenfree</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dare to dream... and face the night with them?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/e78b4eb34608548576f3b1783fd22180.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/65b6d2a2c83b52c529babf6ed42379a5.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span>Long ago, a sacred chestnut tree gave life to three mythical beings, protectors of the dreamworld and guides of the human soul:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Ipno</strong> \u2013 the firstborn, guardian of restful sleep for all living things.<br>\u2022 <strong>Morpheo</strong> \u2013 the middle child, who grants the power to dream and glimpse other realities.<br>\u2022 <strong>Phao</strong> \u2013 the youngest, who wakes beings from dreams and helps them carry meaning into the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when the chestnuts that sustain this balance begin to vanish, the Kasamas grow weaker... and darkness creeps in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/06317a0678df8a88a521a098e919e115.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/a8e90c449eab9bcb66551ed1f7c70a43.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span>Walk through floating forests, forgotten ruins, and shimmering dreamscapes as you piece together Kastania\u2019s lost history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every place you visit reflects a feeling, a memory, or a fear, both personal and ancient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/f5e5a2f715dc2b044733332a7f2e8961.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/05198a91f39c84d2a9b911d73309d1ed.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span>Not all dreams are peaceful.<br>Some hold sorrow. Some conceal truths. Some fight back.<br>But only by facing them can you restore what was lost.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/19c19c733887d02c0f719d0b155d3057.avif?t=1752235253\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><i></i><br><i>Kasama: The Awakening</i> is the first chapter in a cinematic, episodic saga, built for one-night play sessions that leave a lasting impression.</p>",
